{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About the Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a <strong>penguin-politician</strong> trapped inside a closed arena that represents a country. Each round is a tactical struggle for influence. When you collide with other politicians, you compare your influence levels: the weaker one takes damage. Drop to zero? You\u2019re out of the arena. A new contender takes your place \u2014 and the battle goes on.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal is not just to survive, but to <strong>tip the political scales in your favor</strong>. Empower allies, weaken opponents, push your ideology \u2014 and claim dominance over the state.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfdb <strong>Political Arenas</strong> \u2014 each country is a new map with unique rules and opponents.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2696 <strong>Tactical Influence</strong> \u2014 contact clashes where stats and damage decide the outcome.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcc8 <strong>Growing Power</strong> \u2014 strengthen allies to expand your sphere of influence.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc27 <strong>Penguin Politicians</strong> \u2014 charismatic leaders of Arctic ideologies, each with unique traits.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0d <strong>Conquer the World</strong> \u2014 each captured country earns an achievement and brings you closer to global victory.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd04 <strong>Dynamic Opposition</strong> \u2014 defeated politicians leave, making way for new challengers.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2744 Can you turn a cold political game into a blazing victory?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3930710?t=1757360796","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930710/35b8080d97bbdaaadb9e19f944